&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;En &amp;ouml;nemlisini ifade etmek istiyorum. Engelli &amp;ccedil;ocuklara sahip anneler, babalar. Biliyorum &amp;ldquo;benden sonra &amp;ccedil;ocuğuma kim bakacak&amp;rdquo; endişesi taşıyorsunuz. S&amp;ouml;z veriyorum, bizim iktidarımızda, &amp;ccedil;ocuklarınız bize emanet olacak. Bu farkındalıkla da &amp;ouml;ncelikle kendi mek&amp;acirc;nsal ve sosyal organizasyonlarımızdan başlayarak her t&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml; erişim engelini ortadan kaldırmayı şiar ediniyoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613879&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;TOM BARRACK&amp;rsquo;IN A&amp;Ccedil;IKLAMALARI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sizlerin de malumu, ge&amp;ccedil;tiğimiz hafta Papa 14. Leo &amp;uuml;lkemize gelmiş ve bir dizi programlar d&amp;uuml;zenlemişti. Biz daha Papa u&amp;ccedil;ağa binmeden, bu ziyaretin &amp;ldquo;turistik&amp;rdquo; bir gezi olamayacağını; &amp;ouml;zellikle yabancı basından farlı zeminlerde servis edildiğini yine bu k&amp;uuml;rs&amp;uuml;den ifade etmiştik.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Papa&amp;rsquo;nın ziyareti esnasında; yaşanan gelişmeler, endişelerimizin ne kadar yerinde olduğunu ispatladı. Hatırlayacaksınız; ABD&amp;rsquo;nin T&amp;uuml;rkiye B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;kel&amp;ccedil;isi Tom Barrack, ge&amp;ccedil;tiğimiz ay Bahreyn&amp;rsquo;de&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Hazar Denizi&amp;#39;nden Akdeniz&amp;#39;e kadar yeni bir hizalanma g&amp;ouml;receksiniz&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;diyerek,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;b&amp;ouml;lge &amp;uuml;zerindeki dizayn planlarını a&amp;ccedil;ık etmişti.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Şimdi ise bu plan ile ilgili yeni bir aşamayı manidar bir zamanlamayla ve manidar bir yerden, Yunanistan&amp;rsquo;dan ilan ediyor! Aynen şu c&amp;uuml;mleyi kuruyor:&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Hedefimiz, Eyl&amp;uuml;l 2026&amp;rsquo;da Heybeliada Ruhban Okulu&amp;rsquo;nu yeniden a&amp;ccedil;maktır.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Burada asıl mesele; T&amp;uuml;rkiye Cumhuriyeti&amp;rsquo;nin egemenlik haklarına yapılan pervasız saldırıdır! ABD B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;kel&amp;ccedil;isi kim oluyor da, T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;deki bir okul hakkında &amp;ccedil;ıkıp, sanki kendi m&amp;uuml;lk&amp;uuml; &amp;uuml;zerinde tasarrufta bulunuyormuş gibi &amp;ldquo;hedef koyabiliyor&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Burada şunu &amp;ouml;zellikle ifade etmem gerekiyor; Bu hadise, bu y&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;yle Ortodoks vatandaşlarımızla ilgili bir konu değildir. Bizim itirazımız, bu meseleyi T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;ye karşı bir dış baskı aracına d&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;şt&amp;uuml;rme girişiminedir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz daha &amp;ouml;nce de iktidara seslendik:&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Bu a&amp;ccedil;ıklamalara ilk &amp;ouml;nce siz tepki koyun!&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;dedik. Aradan yine g&amp;uuml;nler ge&amp;ccedil;ti; iktidardan ne a&amp;ccedil;ıklama var ne de bir tepki var!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Şimdi, millet adına sormak bizim vazifemiz:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu hadsizliğe karşı neden suskunsunuz?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bir b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;kel&amp;ccedil;i, Yunanistan&amp;rsquo;dan T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;ye takvim dayatırken, sizin sessizliğiniz yoksa &amp;ldquo;ikrar&amp;rdquo;dan mı geliyor?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz; Tom Barrack&amp;rsquo;ın bir g&amp;uuml;n Bahreyn&amp;rsquo;den, bir g&amp;uuml;n Şam&amp;rsquo;dan, bir g&amp;uuml;n Atina&amp;rsquo;dan T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;ye ayar vermeye kalkışmasını adeta bir &amp;ldquo;S&amp;ouml;m&amp;uuml;rge Valisi&amp;rdquo; edasıyla konuşmasını, kabul etmiyor, reddediyoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;rkiye; AK Parti h&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;metine, t&amp;uuml;m yanlış ekonomik kararlarına ikircikli dış politikasına rağmen tarihi ve coğrafyasıyla b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k bir &amp;uuml;lkedir.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu g&amp;uuml;zel &amp;uuml;lkenin kapitalizme, emperyalizme, B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k Ortadoğu Projesine, Siyonizm&amp;rsquo;e yem olmasına asla izin vermeyeceğiz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613880&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;L&amp;Uuml;BNAN ZİYARETİ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Vatikan, İznik i&amp;ccedil;in, Washington, Heybeliada i&amp;ccedil;in hayaller kurarken; bu girişimler barış, hoşg&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;, diyalog ambalajında servis edilirken bir de madalyonun &amp;ouml;b&amp;uuml;r y&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml; var.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biliyorsunuz, Papa T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;den sonra; L&amp;uuml;bnan&amp;rsquo;a gitti. &amp;Ouml;nceki g&amp;uuml;n bizlerde heyetimizle L&amp;uuml;bnan&amp;rsquo;daydık. L&amp;uuml;bnan&amp;rsquo;da tam 12 Filistin kampı bulunuyor. Bu kamplarda Filistinli kardeşlerimiz &amp;ccedil;ok zor şartlarda yaşama tutunmaya &amp;ccedil;alışıyorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İşte tam da bu nedenle; Biz Saadet Partisi, Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş olarak, hem kamplardaki Filistinli kardeşlerimizin hayatına dokunmak, hem de &amp;uuml;zerimize d&amp;uuml;şen insan&amp;icirc; ve ahlaki sorumluluğu yerine getirmek amacıyla iki &amp;ouml;nemli projeyi orada hayata ge&amp;ccedil;irdik.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İlki; merhum Erbakan Hocamızın adını taşıyan &amp;ldquo;Meslek Edindirme Eğitim Merkezi&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu merkezde; bir&amp;ccedil;ok alanda meslek edindirme kursları olacak. Bu merkezle, kardeşlerimize sadece bir meslek kazandırmayacak, onlara kendi ayakları &amp;uuml;zerinde durabilecekleri, kalıcı ve s&amp;uuml;rd&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;lebilir bir yaşam imk&amp;acirc;nı sunacağız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İkincisi: &amp;ldquo;Temiz Kamplar &amp;Ccedil;&amp;ouml;p Toplama Projesi&amp;rdquo; oldu. Bu proje ile de, kamplarda kullanılmak &amp;uuml;zere &amp;ouml;zel dizayn edilmiş &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;p arabalarını hizmete almış olduk. Ziyaretimizde g&amp;ouml;rd&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;z en &amp;ccedil;arpıcı ger&amp;ccedil;ek şuydu: T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;den beklenti &amp;ccedil;ok b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k. Hem tarih&amp;icirc; bağlarımız hem de b&amp;ouml;lgede &amp;uuml;stlendiğimiz misyon gereği, T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin yapacağı her iş, s&amp;ouml;yleyeceği her s&amp;ouml;z dikkatle takip edilmekte. Ancak T&amp;uuml;rkiye &amp;uuml;zerine d&amp;uuml;şeni -maalesef- yerine getirememektedir. Biz Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş olarak, Filistinli kardeşlerimizin yanındayız, olmaya da devam edeceğiz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu vesileyle; Bu projelerin hayata ge&amp;ccedil;mesini sağlayan bunlar gibi bir&amp;ccedil;ok projeyi d&amp;uuml;nyanın d&amp;ouml;rt bir tarafında ger&amp;ccedil;ekleştiren Uluslararası Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş Yardım Organizasyonu&amp;rsquo;muza, kıymetli y&amp;ouml;neticilerine ve isimsiz kahramanlar olan fedak&amp;acirc;r g&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;ll&amp;uuml;lerimize huzurlarınızda bir kez daha ş&amp;uuml;kranlarımı sunuyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613881&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;TER&amp;Ouml;RS&amp;Uuml;Z T&amp;Uuml;RKİYE &amp;ndash; YAŞANABİLİR T&amp;Uuml;RKİYE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;1 Ekim 2024&amp;rsquo;te&amp;nbsp;Sayın Bah&amp;ccedil;eli&amp;rsquo;nin DEM milletvekilleriyle tokalaşmasıyla g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;r hale gelen,&amp;nbsp;daha&amp;nbsp;sonra yine Sayın Bah&amp;ccedil;eli&amp;rsquo;nin grup konuşmalarında yaptığı &amp;ccedil;ağrılarla şekillen,&amp;nbsp;en&amp;nbsp;başından itibaren Cumhurbaşkanı Sayın Erdoğan&amp;rsquo;ın ve iktidar&amp;nbsp;partisinin direktifleriyle y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;len İmralı ziyaretleriyle devam eden s&amp;uuml;reci izliyoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz mevcut iktidarın, 23 yıldır izlediği t&amp;uuml;m politikalarda,&amp;nbsp;bu&amp;nbsp;&amp;uuml;lkede barış ve huzur i&amp;ccedil;erisinde, yaşayabilmek i&amp;ccedil;in, &amp;ldquo;ger&amp;ccedil;ekten yapılması gerekenleri yapmak&amp;rdquo; yerine,&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;k&amp;uuml;resel sermayenin planlarını uygulamak ve kendi&amp;nbsp;&amp;ccedil;ıkarları doğrultusunda tercihlerde bulunduğunu&amp;nbsp;defalarca deneyimlediğimiz&amp;nbsp;halde, yine de &amp;ldquo;yeniden başlamak ve umudu b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;tmek adına&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;Milli Dayanışma, Kardeşlik ve Demokrasi&amp;nbsp;Komsiyonu&amp;rsquo;nda&amp;nbsp;yer aldık.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;8 ay &amp;ouml;nce, Mart&amp;nbsp;ayında Cumhurbaşkanı&amp;nbsp;Sayın Erdoğan,&amp;nbsp;s&amp;uuml;rece&amp;nbsp;dair konuşmuş,&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Kimsenin kendini &amp;ouml;teki olarak hissetmediği,&amp;nbsp;kuşatıcı&amp;nbsp;ve kucaklayıcı bir iklimi &amp;uuml;lkemizde&amp;nbsp;tesis ve tahkim etmek milletimize&amp;nbsp;karşı asli g&amp;ouml;revimizdir.&amp;nbsp;Ter&amp;ouml;rs&amp;uuml;z T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;#39;nin kazananı, Allah&amp;#39;ın izniyle T&amp;uuml;rk, K&amp;uuml;rt, Arap, Alevi, S&amp;uuml;nni, muhalif, muhafazak&amp;acirc;r ayırt etmeksizin 85 milyonun tamamı olacak.&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;demişti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bizim bu s&amp;uuml;rece destek vermedeki amacımız tam olarak budur. 14 aydan daha fazla bir zaman ge&amp;ccedil;ti. S&amp;uuml;re&amp;ccedil; bozulsun istemiyoruz ama&amp;nbsp;her&amp;nbsp;şey&amp;nbsp;Komisyon&amp;nbsp;ve Ada arasında bir oyalamacaya&amp;nbsp;d&amp;ouml;ns&amp;uuml;n de istemiyoruz.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;En başından beri s&amp;ouml;ylediklerimizi tekrar s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yoruz: S&amp;uuml;reci şeffaf bir şekilde y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n, kamuoyunu&amp;nbsp;doğru bilgilendirin.&amp;nbsp;D&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;nce ve ifade &amp;ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml; &amp;uuml;zerindeki kısıtlamaları kaldırın.&amp;nbsp;S&amp;ouml;z s&amp;ouml;yleyene g&amp;ouml;zdağı verme şeklindeki, g&amp;ouml;zaltı uygulamalarına son verin.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Yargının&amp;nbsp;muhalifleri&amp;nbsp;susturmak ve cezalandırmak i&amp;ccedil;in&amp;nbsp;kullanışlı&amp;nbsp;bir aparat olmasına sebep olmayın.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml; ABD ve&amp;nbsp;İsrail&amp;rsquo;den gelen&amp;nbsp;telkinlerde değil,&amp;nbsp;b&amp;ouml;lge&amp;nbsp;&amp;uuml;lkeleri ile&amp;nbsp;hakkı&amp;nbsp;&amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml;n tutan bir anlayışla, samimi&amp;nbsp;bir şekilde yapılan&amp;nbsp;sesimizi duyun,&amp;nbsp;&amp;ouml;nerilerimizi&amp;nbsp;dikkate alın, kandırmacadan, oyalamacadan, algı&amp;nbsp;y&amp;ouml;netiminden vazge&amp;ccedil;in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613882&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;ZG&amp;Uuml;RL&amp;Uuml;KLER VE YASAKLAR AYNI ANDA KONUŞULUYOR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İktidar &amp;uuml;lkemizi &amp;ouml;yle bir noktaya getirdi ki;&amp;nbsp;T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de &amp;ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;kler ve yasaklar aynı anda konuşuluyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Neyin serbest neyin yasak olduğuna, kimin serbest kimin tutuklu kalacağına hukuk değil, iktidar karar veriyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bir tarafta Abdullah &amp;Ouml;calan&amp;rsquo;a &amp;ouml;zg&amp;uuml;rl&amp;uuml;k, genel af konuşulurken, diğer tarafta; Fatih Altaylı&amp;rsquo;ya 4 yıl hapis cezası verilmesi, Selahattin Demirtaş&amp;rsquo;a cumhurbaşkanına hakaretten yeni bir dava a&amp;ccedil;ılması, KHK&amp;rsquo;lıların hi&amp;ccedil; g&amp;uuml;ndeme alınmaması başka bir plan, başka bir niyet, başka bir dizayn mı var; sorularını akıllara getiriyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613883&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;11 YARGI PAKETİ 11 KEZ YAMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İşte 11&amp;rsquo;inci Yargı Paketi g&amp;uuml;ndemde;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;ncelikle: 11. yargı paketi demek, dikiş tutmayan bir elbiseye&amp;nbsp;11. kez yama yapmak demektir.&amp;nbsp;Şunu da s&amp;ouml;ylemeliyim; yama yaptık&amp;ccedil;a,&amp;nbsp;yargıda s&amp;ouml;k&amp;uuml;k b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;yor.&amp;nbsp;Toplumun beklentisi &amp;ldquo;infazda eşitlik yargıda adalet&amp;rdquo; iken bu arkadaşlarımız &amp;ldquo;infazda eşitsizliği, yargıda adaletsizliği&amp;rdquo; tescilleyen bir d&amp;uuml;zenlemeyle karşımıza &amp;ccedil;ıkıyorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Sizler bug&amp;uuml;n katili, hırsızı, dolandırıcıyı, tacizciyi&amp;nbsp;affederseniz;&amp;nbsp;bunlar y&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml;nden mağdur olan vatandaşlarımıza ihanet etmiş olursunuz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Yaptığı &amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;k bina y&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml;nden insanların canına mal olan m&amp;uuml;teahhidi&amp;nbsp;affederseniz;&amp;nbsp;vefat edenlerin ruhuna, onların yakınlarına ihanet etmiş olursunuz. Bunu cezasız bırakarak diğer m&amp;uuml;teahhitlere cesaret verirsiniz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;ocuğunu, uyuşturucunun pen&amp;ccedil;esinden kurtarmaya, &amp;ccedil;alışan annelerin feryadı ortadayken uyuşturucu satıcısını&amp;nbsp;affederseniz;&amp;nbsp;o annenin ahını alır, yeni annelerin acısına zemin hazırlarsınız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İnsanların yıllarca dişinden ve tırnağından artırarak yaptığı birikimini bir saniyede &amp;ccedil;alan hırsızları&amp;nbsp;affederseniz;&amp;nbsp;o insanların emeğine, helal kazancına ve alın terine ihanet edersiniz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

