&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613884&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;BUNLARA NEDEN AF YOK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Dolandırıcı affedilecek; ama akademisyen i&amp;ccedil;eride kalmaya devam edecek. Hırsız affedilecek; ama gazeteci i&amp;ccedil;eride kalmaya devam edecek. Sahtekar m&amp;uuml;teahhit affedilecek; ama bir tweet y&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml;nden i&amp;ccedil;eri atılan binlerce insan i&amp;ccedil;eride kalacak. Hi&amp;ccedil; kusura bakmayın, alınmayın, g&amp;uuml;cenmeyin! Adına ister&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;Af&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;ister&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;D&amp;uuml;zenleme&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;deyip laf cambazlığı yapmaya &amp;ccedil;alışın.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ger&amp;ccedil;ekte yaptığınız; ahlaklı vatandaşa, kurala uyan masuma ceza, su&amp;ccedil;lunun su&amp;ccedil;una rızadır.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613885&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;GER&amp;Ccedil;EK AMA&amp;Ccedil;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;nceki yargı paketlerinde olduğu gibi bu yargı paketinde de ama&amp;ccedil;lanan kapasitesinin &amp;ccedil;ok &amp;ccedil;ok &amp;uuml;zerinde dolu olan cezaevlerinden adli su&amp;ccedil;luları tahliye edip siyasi muhaliflere yer a&amp;ccedil;maktır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;100 bin, 150 bin ya da 200 bin h&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;ml&amp;uuml; infazdan yararlanıp tahliye ediliyor ancak bir yıl i&amp;ccedil;erisinde aynı su&amp;ccedil;lar daha fazla insan tarafından yeniden işleniyor. İktidarın ilk yapması gereken şey &amp;ldquo;nasıl oluyor da her sene 150-200 bin kişi su&amp;ccedil; işleyip cezaevine giriyor?&amp;rdquo; sorusunun cevabını bulmaktır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz sizleri bir kez daha uyarıyoruz; &amp;ouml;nce ahlak ve maneviyat şuuruna dayanan bir toplumu inşa etmeye &amp;ouml;ncelik vermezseniz hi&amp;ccedil;bir su&amp;ccedil;un &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;ne ge&amp;ccedil;emezsiniz! Fabrika yerine cezaevi, okul yerine ıslah evi, araştırma merkezi yerine uyuşturucu ile m&amp;uuml;cadele merkezi a&amp;ccedil;mak zorunda kalırsınız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613886&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;HALK SAĞLIĞI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bunları ni&amp;ccedil;in s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yorum; sadece ge&amp;ccedil;tiğimiz aydan bir &amp;ouml;rnek vereyim. Malumunuz T&amp;uuml;rkiye Kasım ayını zehirlenme vakaları ile ge&amp;ccedil;irdi. Bir anda t&amp;uuml;m T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;#39;de zabıtaların restoran, lokanta ve kafelere yaptıkları baskınları g&amp;ouml;rmeye başladık.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;ncelikle h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;alk sağlığı sadece zabıta baskınları ile sağlanamaz!&amp;nbsp;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;m baskın değil, sistemli denetimdir. İkincisi&amp;nbsp;ve daha &amp;ouml;nemlisi; kafelerin, restoranların, kasapların yani halk sağlığını ve gıda g&amp;uuml;venliğini ilgilendiren bir&amp;ccedil;ok yerin denetlenmesi i&amp;ccedil;in&amp;nbsp;illa canlarımızı vermemiz mi gerekirdi?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Madende g&amp;ouml;&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;k olur, madencilerimiz vefat eder; maden denetlemeleri başlar! Otelde yangın olur, 78 vatandaşımız hayatını kaybeder; otellerde denetim başlar! Ka&amp;ccedil;ak depoda parf&amp;uuml;m imalatı yapılır, 7 vatandaşımız hayatını kaybeder; ertesi g&amp;uuml;n t&amp;uuml;m T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;#39;de iş yerlerine baskın yapılır! İla&amp;ccedil;lama y&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml;nden bir aile yok olur; ila&amp;ccedil;lama şirketlerine denetim yapılır. Allah aşkına, bu &amp;uuml;lkede insanımız &amp;ouml;lmeden denetim ve takip yapılmayacak mı?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613887&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;S&amp;Uuml;RE&amp;Ccedil;LERDE YOKSUN!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;İktidara bakıyoruz!&amp;nbsp;Olaylar yaşanırken hi&amp;ccedil; gıkları &amp;ccedil;ıkmıyor! S&amp;uuml;re&amp;ccedil;te hi&amp;ccedil; yoklar. Hep sonu&amp;ccedil;lar &amp;uuml;zerine konuşuyorlar. Sonu&amp;ccedil;lar &amp;uuml;zerine herkes konuşur. S&amp;uuml;re&amp;ccedil;ler &amp;uuml;zerine konuşun, s&amp;uuml;rece gelin.&amp;nbsp;Bir kez de felaketten &amp;ouml;nce &amp;ouml;nlem alın! İnsanımızı d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;yormuş &amp;ldquo;gibi&amp;rdquo; yapmaktan vazge&amp;ccedil;in. Denetim yapıyormuş &amp;ldquo;gibi&amp;rdquo; g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;nmekten vazge&amp;ccedil;in. Mış &amp;ldquo;gibi&amp;rdquo; yaparak devlet y&amp;ouml;netilmez!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bizim; yangına, g&amp;ouml;&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;ğe, zehirlenmeye verecek canımız da tahamm&amp;uuml;l&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;z de kalmadı!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613888&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ASGARİ &amp;Uuml;CRETLİ VE EMEKLİ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bakınız ben size bir s&amp;uuml;re&amp;ccedil;ten daha bahsedeyim:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Asgari &amp;uuml;cret! Bug&amp;uuml;n T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de 16 milyon insanımız asgari &amp;uuml;cret alıyor. Adı &amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml;nde asgari &amp;uuml;cret. Bir alt sınır olarak konan bu &amp;uuml;cret, k&amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml; ekonomi y&amp;uuml;z&amp;uuml;nden bir temel &amp;uuml;cret haline geldi. Zamları otomatiğe bağlayan ve neredeyse her ay hatta, her hafta zam yapan iktidar sıra asgari &amp;uuml;cretliye emekliye gelince bin dereden su getiriyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin-right:-19px; text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Komisyonlar toplanıyor, m&amp;uuml;zakereler yapılıyor, masalara oturuluyor, masalardan kalkılıyor adeta tam bir tiyatro sahneleniyor. Vatandaştan alırken kep&amp;ccedil;eyle alan iktidar, vatandaşa verirken kaşıkla bile vermiyor. Bug&amp;uuml;n a&amp;ccedil;lık sınırı 29.828 TL olmuş durumda. Buna karşılık; asgari &amp;uuml;cretin 26 bin, 27 bin en y&amp;uuml;ksek 28 bin TL civarı olması tartışılıyor. Cumhuriyet tarihinde yine bir ilk ger&amp;ccedil;ekleşiyor ve a&amp;ccedil;lık sınırının altında bir asgari &amp;uuml;cret tartışılıyor!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613889&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;EMEKLİ OLUP &amp;Ccedil;ALIŞMAK ZORUNDA KALMAK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Gelelim emeklimize! Bug&amp;uuml;n T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;de emekli olup ge&amp;ccedil;inemediği i&amp;ccedil;in &amp;ccedil;alışmak zorunda kalan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;8 milyon emeklimiz var. 75 yaşındaki Ahmet Şahin Amca &amp;ccedil;alışmak zorunda olduğu i&amp;ccedil;in g&amp;ouml;&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;k altında kalarak can verdi.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;65 yaşındaki Mehmet Amca Taksi şof&amp;ouml;rl&amp;uuml;ğ&amp;uuml; yaparken kalp krizi ge&amp;ccedil;irerek vefat etti, yanındaki emekli arkadaşı da ona m&amp;uuml;dahale ederken vefat etti. İbrahim Amca 63 yaşında tır direksiyonunda kalp krizi ge&amp;ccedil;irdi. Bunun gibi y&amp;uuml;zlerce dram var.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Neden? &amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; Ahmet amca ge&amp;ccedil;inemiyor, &amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; Ayşe teyze pazara &amp;ccedil;ıkamıyor. &amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; emekliye reva g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;len &amp;uuml;cret; a&amp;ccedil;lık sınırının yarısına denk geliyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613890&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;EMEKLİ BANKTA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu amcalarımız niye bankta oturuyor? &amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; artık bu &amp;uuml;lkede, emeklimizin aldığı maaş &amp;ccedil;ay ocağında &amp;ccedil;ay i&amp;ccedil;mesine bile izin vermiyor. O y&amp;uuml;zden, bu amcalarımız belediye parkında, yaptığınız millet bah&amp;ccedil;elerinde &amp;ccedil;ay parası bulamadığı i&amp;ccedil;in bankta oturuyor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Hasan amcanın durumu bu. Bu arada; bizi kıskanıyor dediğiniz Almanya&amp;rsquo;daki Hans ise Antalya&amp;rsquo;da, şezlongda denizin, kumun, g&amp;uuml;neşin tadını &amp;ccedil;ıkarıyor. Hasan amca bankta, Hans amca şezlongda. Bir iktidar, 23 yılın sonunda bunu kendi halkına nasıl reva g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;r?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613891&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;Uuml;Y&amp;Uuml;ME RAKAMLARI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu arada; iktidar &amp;ldquo;%3.7 b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;d&amp;uuml;k&amp;rdquo; diyor. Milli gelirimiz 1,5 trilyon dolar oldu diyor. Kişi başına d&amp;uuml;şen milli gelir 17 bin dolara y&amp;uuml;kseldi diyor. Şimdi sormak lazım; emekli Hasan amca ve asgari &amp;uuml;cretli Ali kardeşim bu b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;menin neresinde? Ni&amp;ccedil;in, asgari &amp;uuml;cretlimizin bundan haberi yok? Ni&amp;ccedil;in emekli Hasan amcanın payına millet bah&amp;ccedil;esinde banklarda oturmak d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;yor?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613892&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;ROMA NEDEN YIKILDI?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Meşhur hatip &amp;Ccedil;i&amp;ccedil;ero&amp;rsquo;ya &amp;ldquo;Roma neden yıkıldı&amp;rdquo; diye sorarlar;&amp;nbsp;&amp;ldquo;&amp;Ccedil;ok ve g&amp;uuml;zel konuştuk, fakat bilgisizdik!&amp;rdquo;&amp;nbsp;Cevabını verir. İktidarın bug&amp;uuml;n yaptığı tam da budur. &amp;Ccedil;ok konuşuyorlar, g&amp;uuml;zel konuşuyorlar ama bilgisizce ve liyakatsizce y&amp;ouml;netiyorlar.Ha olumlu şeyler yok mu, tabiki var! Bunları da desteklemeyi, alkışlamayı bir g&amp;ouml;rev biliriz. &amp;Ouml;rneğin bu hafta T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;#39;nin ilk insansız savaş u&amp;ccedil;ağı olan Bayraktar Kızılelma&amp;#39;nın testi başarılı ile ge&amp;ccedil;mesinden dolayı b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k bir mutluluk ve gurur duyduk. Bu projede emeği ge&amp;ccedil;en, alın teri d&amp;ouml;ken herkesi kutluyorum; teşekk&amp;uuml;r ediyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613893&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;Uuml;T&amp;Ccedil;EDEN MUTLU OLAN MUTLU AZINLIK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;e, &amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;zdeki hafta genel kurula geliyor. Bu b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;enin de &amp;ouml;ncekiler gibi tam da iktidarın 23 yıllık misyonuyla uyumlu bir b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;e olduğunu g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;yoruz. Yine &amp;ouml;ncekiler gibi emek&amp;ccedil;iden alıp k&amp;uuml;resel sermayeye ve faize aktarma g&amp;ouml;revini yerine getiriyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Tabi! Bu b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;eden mutlu olan mutlu bir azınlık da var!&amp;nbsp;Aynı gemide olmadığımız &amp;ccedil;evreler var.&amp;nbsp;İlk olarak faiz lobileri&amp;nbsp;bu b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;eden rahatsız değil. &amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; 2026&amp;rsquo;da; emek&amp;ccedil;inin hakkı olan 2 trilyon 741 milyar lira faize &amp;ouml;denecek. Bu b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;eden iktidar rahatsız değil! B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;e teklifinde &amp;ouml;ng&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;len gider 18,9 trilyon lira, &amp;ouml;ng&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;len gelir ise 16,2 trilyon lira. B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;e, daha işe başlarken, 2,7 trilyon lira a&amp;ccedil;ık veriyor. Ama iktidar bundan hi&amp;ccedil; hicap duymuyor. Bu b&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;eden yandaşlar rahatsız değil!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml; paylarını fazlasıyla alıyorlar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Yani değerli arkadaşlar, aslında ekonomik bir kriz yok!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Ge&amp;ccedil;imi, iktidar eliyle krize sokulan insanlar var.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613894&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;HEPİMİZ AYNI GEMİDE DEĞİLİZ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;eye baktığımızda; gelir dağılımında ve vergilendirmede yine adaletsizlik g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;yoruz. Burada sıkıntıyı iktidar partisine oy versin ya da vermesin hep emek&amp;ccedil;iler &amp;ccedil;ekiyor. Bakınız, az &amp;ouml;nce bahsettiğim &amp;ccedil;evrelerle aynı gemide olmadığımızı g&amp;ouml;steren bir rakam daha vereceğim.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;ede 3 trilyon 597 milyar liralık bir &amp;ldquo;Vergi harcaması&amp;rdquo; &amp;ouml;ng&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;l&amp;uuml;yor. &amp;ldquo;Vergi harcaması&amp;rdquo; ne demek biliyor musunuz? Silinecek vergi demektir. Sermayeden, yandaştan alınmayacak vergi demektir.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;te taraftan milletin cebinden &amp;ccedil;ıkacak vergilere bakalım:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;ede Gelir Vergisi&amp;rsquo;nden 3,6 trilyon,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;TV&amp;rsquo;den 2,5 trilyon,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;KDV&amp;rsquo;den 3,5 trilyon,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Kurumlar Vergisi&amp;rsquo;nden 1,7 trilyon lira gelir hedefleniyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Yani yoksuldan, dar gelirliden, sabit gelirliden, k&amp;uuml;&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;k işletme sahiplerinden alınacak. Yine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;faize ve k&amp;uuml;resel sermayeye aktarılacak. T&amp;uuml;m bunlardan sonra Sayın Şimşeğin: &amp;ldquo;B&amp;uuml;t&amp;ccedil;e arzuladığımız yere geldi&amp;rdquo; demesi bizi ciddi ş&amp;uuml;pheye d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;rd&amp;uuml;. Sizin arzuladığınız, milletimizin kaynaklarını faizcilere, yandaşlara aktarmak mı? Hepimiz &amp;ldquo;aynı gemideyiz&amp;rdquo; diyerek matematiği &amp;ccedil;arpıtmaya gerek yok.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Toc215613895&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;KAPANIŞ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Değerli arkadaşlar,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Konuşmam boyunca sıraladığım t&amp;uuml;m bu sorunların; zehirlenen &amp;ccedil;ocuklarımızın, cezasız kalan su&amp;ccedil;luların, ge&amp;ccedil;inemeyen emeklilerin tek bir ortak sebebi var: Y&amp;ouml;netilemeyen bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu iktidar, su&amp;ccedil;luyu affeden ama d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;nceyi hapseden; m&amp;uuml;teahhidi koruyan ama depremzedeyi unutan bir anlayışla miadını doldurmuştur. Onlar, 11 kez yama yaptıkları yargı paketleriyle adaleti &amp;ouml;ld&amp;uuml;re dursunlar; bizler hakkı &amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml;n tutmaya devam edeceğiz.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz, annelere &amp;ldquo;benden sonra &amp;ccedil;ocuğuma ne olacak&amp;rdquo; dedirtmeyen bir devlet i&amp;ccedil;in varız. Biz, su&amp;ccedil;lunun değil masumun korunduğu bir adalet i&amp;ccedil;in varız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Biz, asgari &amp;uuml;cretlinin a&amp;ccedil;lığa mahk&amp;ucirc;m edilmediği bir d&amp;uuml;zen i&amp;ccedil;in varız. Engelli kardeşimin umudu biziz. Emekli amcamızın g&amp;uuml;vencesi biziz. Filistinli mazlumun sesi biziz. Biz, ter&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;n de, yoksulluğun da, adaletsizliğin de bu topraklardan s&amp;ouml;k&amp;uuml;l&amp;uuml;p atılmasını istiyoruz. Bunun i&amp;ccedil;in de &amp;ccedil;alışmaya devam edeceğiz.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Bu duygu ve d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;ncelerle s&amp;ouml;zlerimi bitiriyor, hepinizi h&amp;uuml;rmet ve muhabbetle selamlıyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
